{"sections":[],"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"The issuer number of the highest scheme you listed under "},{"code":"LSApplicationQueriesSchemes","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":".","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"E.g. pass 39, if you listed all schemes from “twint-issuer1” up to and including “twint-issuer39”."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"The value is clamped between 0 and 39."}],"primaryContentSections":[{"declarations":[{"platforms":["iOS"],"tokens":[{"text":"var","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"kind":"identifier","text":"maxIssuerNumber"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Int","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:Si"}],"languages":["swift"]}],"kind":"declarations"},{"content":[{"level":2,"type":"heading","text":"Discussion","anchor":"discussion"},{"type":"aside","style":"important","content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"All apps above “twint-issuer39” will always be returned if one of these apps is installed."},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"For this to work, ","type":"text"},{"code":"LSApplicationQueriesSchemes","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" must include “twint-extended”.","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"If you configure any "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"maxIssuerNumber"},{"type":"text","text":" below 39, the result will always contain all apps above "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"maxIssuerNumber"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":"up to and including 39, even if none of them are installed."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"text":"Additionally, if the fetch fails and the cache is empty, none of these apps will be found when probing.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"name":"Important"}],"kind":"content"}],"identifier":{"interfaceLanguage":"swift","url":"doc:\/\/Adyen\/documentation\/Adyen\/AdyenActionComponent\/Configuration-swift.struct\/Twint-swift.struct\/maxIssuerNumber"},"kind":"symbol","variants":[{"paths":